{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, then approach, take, move, process properties, else if destination reached, perform task, else explore. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = isObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = isDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    />",
